---
eleventyNavigation:
  key: "Home"
  order: 1

numberOfLatestPostsToShow: 3
---
{% set postsCount = collections.blog | length %}
{% set latestPostsCount = postsCount | min(numberOfLatestPostsToShow) %}

	<div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
		<div class="col-lg-8">
			<h1 class="display-4 mb-4">Welcome to Linked Open Data for Ancient Metallurgy</h1>
			{#- DRAFT by Claude in the owner's voice (planning#16): the owner reviews and rewrites. -#}
			<p>Hi, I'm Fabian. LOD-AM (Linked Open Data for Ancient Metallurgy) is my side project on copper-based metallurgy in Eurasia. Archaeometallurgical data is scattered across decades of publications; I bring it together and publish it as Linked Open Data that anyone can browse, cite and reuse.</p>
			<p>What started as a sandbox for experiments now has a working data model, its own controlled vocabularies and a first dataset online: the finds and analyses from Arslantepe published by Hauptmann et al. (2002). More publications follow one by one. The blog is my research diary: how LOD-AM is built, including the detours and the Research Data Management (RDM) chaos along the way.</p>

			{%- set nFinds = lodam.byKind.find.length %}{% set nAnalyses = lodam.byKind.analysis.length %}{% set nPubs = lodam.releasedPublications.length %}
			{%- if nFinds %}
			<aside class="series-box data-box mb-4" aria-labelledby="explore-heading">
				<h2 id="explore-heading" class="h5 mb-2">Explore the data</h2>
				<p class="mb-2">{{ nFinds }} finds and {{ nAnalyses }} analyses from {{ nPubs }} publication{% if nPubs != 1 %}s{% endif %}, with their sites, contexts and dating. Every record can be cited and downloaded.</p>
				<ul class="mb-0">
					<li><a href="/data/">Overview of the released data</a></li>
					{%- for key in ["site", "find", "analysis"] %}{% if lodam.byKind[key].length %}
					<li><a href="/data/{{ lodam.KINDS[key].slug }}/">{{ lodam.KINDS[key].plural }}</a></li>
					{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
					{%- for p in lodam.releasedPublications %}
					<li><a href="{{ p.path }}analyses/">All analyses in {{ p.citation }}</a></li>
					{%- endfor %}
				</ul>
			</aside>
			{%- endif %}

			{% set seriesId = "goals-reached" %}
			{% include "start-here.njk" %}

			{% set seriesId = "becoming-operational" %}
			{% include "start-here.njk" %}

			{% set seriesId = "building-lod-am" %}
			{% include "start-here.njk" %}

			<h2 class="mt-5 mb-4">Latest post{% if latestPostsCount != 1 %}s{% endif %}</h2>
			
			{% set postslist = collections.blog | head(-1 * numberOfLatestPostsToShow) %}
			{% set headingLevel = 3 %}
			{% include "bloglist.njk" %}
			
			{% set morePosts = postsCount - numberOfLatestPostsToShow %}
			{% if morePosts > 0 %}
			<p class="mt-4">{{ morePosts }} more post{% if morePosts != 1 %}s{% endif %} in the <a href="/blog/">blog archive</a>.</p>
			{% endif %}
		</div>
	</div>
